WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:03.003
Officer:
What are we gonna do?

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:03.921
♪♪

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:06.173
We'll bring hell down from
on high.

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:31.740
♪♪

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.825
(Explosion)

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:34.826
(Gun fire)

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:39.623
(Explosion)

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:41.041
♪♪

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.460
Congratulations on your first
command.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.670
Evie:
At last.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.881
♪♪

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.675
Commander Krause:
I'll always be looking for you,
Evie.

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:52.761
Commander Krause:
Even if I'm a thousand miles
away.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.596
♪♪

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.014
(Radio voice)
Air escort to Greyhound.

00:00:56.807 --> 00:00:59.434
(Radio voice)
You will now be out of range of
air cover for the next 5 days.

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:01.144
(Radio voice)
How many crossing does this
make?

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:02.312
This is my first.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.357
(Sonar beeping)

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:06.441
I got something.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:07.859
Most likely a U-boat.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.404
He's trying to slip under us!

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:11.780
Officer:
Fire!

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:15.909
We have a kill.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.703
(Cheering)

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:19.621
Officer:
Distress rocket, Sir.

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:22.708
♪♪

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:25.085
We have hits directly on the
convoy.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.462
A wolfpack's hunting us.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.382
U-boat, starboard bow!

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:34.011
♪♪

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:36.596
Commander Krause:
We've lost 7 ships and 50 souls.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.976
What you did yesterday, got us
to today.

00:01:40.976 --> 00:01:41.977
It's not enough.

00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:46.606
♪♪

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.607
Fire as they bear!

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.069
♪♪

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:51.820
(Cheering)

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.071
(Gunshots)

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:54.865
(Explosion)

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:56.158
Target's disappeared, Sir.

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:02.998
(Sonar beeping)

00:02:02.998 --> 00:02:03.832
Here they come. 

00:02:05.208 --> 00:02:06.418
Officer:
What are we gonna do?

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:08.462
We'll bring hell down from
on high.

00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:14.509
♪♪

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:15.761
(Crashing sound)

00:02:15.761 --> 00:02:19.306
♪♪

